            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Display Toggle 1.03

## Fix

- When an external display is unplugged while your built-in display is turned
  off, Display Toggle now reliably turns the built-in display back on, even if
  macOS briefly removes it from the display list during the switch.

Requires macOS 13 Ventura or later. A purchase includes updates through Display
Toggle 2.x.
]]></description>
